
DOUBLE(1)           UNIX Programmer's Manual            DOUBLE(1)

NAME
     double - double strike output for faint ribbons

SYNOPSIS
     double [ file ... ]

DESCRIPTION
     _D_o_u_b_l_e double strikes each of the specified files, or the
     standard input for printing dark copies with faint ribbons.

